{"unit_id":"PeterBon__dsh-hooks#card-zh","repo":"PeterBon/dsh-hooks","commit":"460219cf687733a9930c6fc2145fee33dde233b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hooks 是面向 DSH Web 与命令行环境的生命周期钩子插件，可在配置文件中将会话、回合、工具、审批和 agent 状态等事件关联到命令或内置通知。它订阅会话事件并按条件筛选，再在后台运行命令或发送桌面、Webhook、飞书通知；也提供 Web 设置页、钩子测试、历史记录、失败提醒和每日 token 用量事件。适合希望把 DSH 工作流接入个人脚本、消息提醒或本地自动化的用户。命令可接收事件环境变量或完整 JSON 输入；按需使用飞书时要配置应用凭证和接收方。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:138","src/config.ts:4","src/notify.ts:194","src/client/index.ts:31"]}
{"unit_id":"PeterBon__dsh-hooks#card-en","repo":"PeterBon/dsh-hooks","commit":"460219cf687733a9930c6fc2145fee33dde233b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hooks links DSH events to commands and notifications. It filters session, turn, tool, approval, and agent events, then runs commands or sends desktop, webhook, or Feishu messages. A Web settings page provides history and manual testing. Commands receive event variables or JSON input.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:138","src/config.ts:4","src/notify.ts:194","src/client/index.ts:31"]}
