{"unit_id":"PeterBon__dsh-hooks#feature-event-hooks","repo":"PeterBon/dsh-hooks","commit":"460219cf687733a9930c6fc2145fee33dde233b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"生命周期事件钩子：可监听回合、工具、审批、会话和 agent 等事件，并按原因或上下文字段筛选。匹配后运行配置命令或通知，不阻塞 agent 主流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.ts:4","src/index.ts:431"]}
